Computes the eigenvalues of a square matrix.

Letting :math:`\mathbb{K}` be :math:`\mathbb{R}` or :math:`\mathbb{C}`,
the **eigenvalues** of a square matrix :math:`A \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times n}` are defined
